{"title":"반로환동인 줄 알았다","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bdxsZx/hAJmEqlBli/qD7cwYOfK9bkUCbojJPGx1&filename=th3","synopsis":"40년 동안 갇혀 지낸 진식을 파괴하려다 쓰러졌는데\n정신을 차리고 보니 20대의 젊은 몸이 되었다.\n\n\"으하하하! 내가 반로환동의 고수가 되었... 으응?\"\n젊어지긴했는데...평생을 수련해 온 일 갑자의 내공이 사라졌다?!\n\n반로환동인 줄 알았는데 빙의라니!\n\n게다가 몸의 주인은 허약하기로 중원 제일이라\n별호조차 \"무무(無武)\"라는 유세옥.\n\n내공을 잃은 대신 젊음과 자유, 그리고 가족을 얻은 무극문의 유일한 전승자 강대산,\n이렇게 된 거 어쩔 수 없지, 무공이야 회복하면 그만이야.\n\n창천유가의 둘째 공자, 약골 유세옥이 되어 펼치는 그의 통쾌한 행보가 시작된다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":105,"change":{"type":"up","amount":179}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":98,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":92,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":88,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":101,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":72,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":83,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":87,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":88,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":77,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":83,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":81,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":90,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":95,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":95,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":81,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":102,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":110,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":96,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":61,"change":{"type":"up","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":85,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":88,"change":{